   "en": "Back in elementary school, she was the class clown.\nEven now in high school, Tanishi still puts her heart and soul into making everyone laugh.\nOne day, she falls for Ando, who sits next to her.\nHowever, it seems Ando already has his eyes on someone else...\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
